# Product Requirements Document (PRD)

# myholidayNow – Holiday Membership, Travel & Resort Booking Platform

Product specification

Website + Web Application

# myholidayNow

Premium Holiday Membership & Travel Experience Platform

Product reference: MyHolidayz, VentureVibe Global Hoppers, Club Mahindra and Club Nebula.

Proposed domain: myholidays.in

Product vision: Build a premium holiday membership platform where customers can explore destinations, purchase holiday memberships, access exclusive resort benefits, manage membership entitlements, book holidays and manage their complete travel experience online.

## 1. Executive summary

The objective is to develop a premium holiday membership and travel booking website for myholidayNow, using the existing MyHolidayz website as the starting business reference and taking inspiration from the membership experience offered by Club Mahindra and Club Nebula.

The platform should not be limited to a normal travel booking website.

It should combine three major business models:

1. Holiday membership business: Customers purchase a membership for a defined period and receive specified holiday entitlements and benefits.
2. Holiday booking marketplace: Customers explore resorts, destinations, packages and available holiday options.
3. Membership management platform: Existing members log in, view their benefits, check eligibility, request or book holidays, manage payments and track reservations.

The website should have two distinct experiences:

- Public-facing marketing website for attracting and converting new members.
- Logged-in member portal for managing memberships and holiday reservations.

It should also provide a powerful internal CRM and admin panel for managing leads, membership sales, resorts, bookings, payments and customer support.

