# 7. Holiday membership business model – Core product functionality

This is the most important part of the entire platform.

myholidayNow should have a configurable membership engine that manages the customer's entire membership lifecycle.

The membership model should be designed independently of the marketing website.

## 7.1 Membership plan configuration

Admin should be able to create unlimited membership plans.

Each plan should have the following configuration:

| Parameter           | Description                                |
| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |
| Plan name           | Escape Select, Escape Elite, etc.          |
| Membership type     | Domestic / International / Combined        |
| Membership duration | 3 / 5 / custom years                       |
| Membership price    | Total membership price                     |
| Down payment        | Initial payment                            |
| EMI option          | Installment configuration                  |
| Annual entitlement  | Nights or other approved holiday units     |
| Room category       | Standard / Deluxe / Premium / Suite        |
| Occupancy           | Adults and children                        |
| Resort access       | Eligible resort list                       |
| Booking window      | Minimum and maximum advance booking period |
| Season access       | Applicable travel seasons                  |
| Blackout dates      | Restricted booking dates                   |
| Guest privileges    | Rules for gifting/guest bookings           |
| Renewal             | Renewal eligibility                        |
| Transferability     | Membership transfer rules                  |
| Cancellation        | Cancellation rules                         |
| Additional fees     | Applicable booking or service charges      |

All values should be configurable, not hardcoded.

