## 8.3 Online holiday booking

[softwareadvice.ie](https://www.softwareadvice.ie/software/3094/resnexus?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

This should be a complete reservation request system.

Booking flow:

1. Select destination

   Choose a destination, city, country or resort.
2. Select resort

   View eligible resorts and room categories.
3. Select travel dates

   Choose check-in and check-out dates.
4. Select guests

   Enter adults, children and room requirements.
5. Check membership eligibility

   Verify the customer's membership, entitlements and booking rules.
6. Check resort availability

   Check inventory or submit a request for manual availability confirmation.
7. Review booking

   Show entitlement deduction and applicable charges.
8. Confirm booking request

   Submit the reservation and generate a booking reference.
9. Reservation confirmation

   Reservation team confirms the resort and sends the final voucher.

