I would position myholidayNow as:

# myholidayNow

## Your Holidays. Your World. Your Membership.

A complete holiday membership and travel ecosystem.

Travel Website

Destinations, resorts and holiday packages.

Membership Platform

Membership plans, benefits and entitlements.

Booking Engine

Reservations, resort availability and vouchers.

Member Portal

Membership and holiday management.

Sales CRM

Leads, sales and membership conversions.

Admin Platform

Complete business and operations management.

The key strategic decision is to build this as a holiday membership management SaaS-style business platform with a premium travel marketplace, not simply a travel website.

That will give myholidayNow the ability to manage the entire customer lifecycle, from the first enquiry to membership purchase, annual holiday entitlement, resort reservation, customer support and future membership renewal.

